@base = http://localhost:5256

### Get Wallet
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/1
Accept: application/json

### topup
POST {{base}}/api/wallets/3/topups
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentMethodId" : 1,
    "amount" : 53000
}

### Get Topup
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/3/topups/detail
Accept: application/json


### confirm pembayaran
PATCH {{base}}/api/wallets/1/topups/confirm
Accept: application/json